/* zh-SG translations for "ch16" (generated by tools/i18n-pack.js; keys are the English source). */
Object.assign(window.I18N['zh-SG'].text, {
  "Chapter 16": "第十六章",
  "Book Out": "放假出营",
  "Part V — On Your Own": "第五部 · 自己的路",
  "Chapter 17 — Chalet Night": "第十七章 · 度假屋之夜",
  "You enlisted in March. Weekdays in camp: 5:30 AM wake-ups, a shaved head, a section of strangers slowly turning into friends.": "你三月入伍了。平日在营里：早上五点半起床、剃光的头、一班陌生人慢慢变成朋友。",
  "I have also enlisted. Morale support. My rank is Cat.": "我也入伍了。负责提振士气。军衔是：猫。",
  "First book-out weekend. You've ordered delivery four nights in a row, and Mum is still doing your laundry.": "第一个放假周末。你连续四晚叫外卖，妈妈还在帮你洗衣服。",
  "Your NSF allowance is not for Grab Food every day, ah. And your uniform won't wash itself.": "你的服役津贴不是给你每天叫外卖的哦。还有你的制服不会自己洗。",
  "Mum has a point. Mum usually has a point.": "妈妈说得有道理。妈妈通常都有道理。",
  "Learn three cheap dishes, cook one for the family, do your own laundry, set a hawker budget.": "学三道便宜的菜，煮一道给家人吃，自己洗衣服，订个小贩中心预算。",
  "Egg fried rice, a passable tomato egg, and a soup Dad calls \"brave\". Mum takes a photo for the family chat.": "蛋炒饭、还可以的番茄炒蛋，还有一锅被爸爸形容为“很勇敢”的汤。妈妈拍照发到家庭群。",
  "Next week, you move the sofa so I can clean behind.": "下礼拜你帮我搬沙发，我要扫后面。",
  "You move the sofa. Then the cupboard. Then, somehow, the fridge.": "你搬了沙发。然后是柜子。然后，不知道怎么回事，连冰箱都搬了。",
  "Keep ordering. Mum probably enjoys laundry.": "继续叫外卖。妈妈应该很享受洗衣服吧。",
  "Twenty-one dollars for noodles plus delivery fee. Your allowance is evaporating. So is Mum's patience.": "一碗面加运费二十一块。你的津贴在蒸发。妈妈的耐心也是。",
  "Instant noodles every weekend.": "每个周末都吃泡面。",
  "Cheap. Also a diet designed by a raccoon. Learn one vegetable.": "很省。也很像浣熊设计的菜单。学一种青菜吧。",
  "A mall kiosk: \"New phone, $0 today! Buy now, pay later!\" Next to it, a gaming PC with \"only $89 a month\" in giant letters.": "商场的摊位：“新手机，今天$0！先买后付！”旁边一台电竞电脑，大字写着“每月只要$89”。",
  "Your old phone has a crack shaped like a lightning bolt.": "你的旧手机有一条闪电形状的裂痕。",
  "Read the terms and the total. Walk away, or buy one small thing you can actually pay off.": "看清条款和总额。走开，或者只买一样你真的还得起的小东西。",
  "\"$0 today\" means \"everything later, plus late fees\".": "“今天$0”的意思是“全部以后付，再加迟付费”。",
  "Stack three BNPL plans for a gaming PC, \"for my passion\".": "叠三个先买后付分期，买电竞电脑，“为了我的兴趣”。",
  "Three apps, three due dates, one allowance. By month two you're late on two of them.": "三个应用、三个截止日、一份津贴。第二个月，你就有两个迟付了。",
  "Late fees are piling up. An ad pops up: \"Fast cash, no questions.\"": "迟付费越叠越多。弹出一个广告：“快速借钱，不问原因。”",
  "Stop. List every payment, call each company, ask Dad to help make a plan.": "停。列出每一笔款项，打给每一家公司，请爸爸帮你订计划。",
  "Okay. Spreadsheet. With colours. You learned that from somewhere.": "好。电子表格。有颜色的。你是跟谁学的哦。",
  "Take the loan to cover them, then add a few more plans for dates and gadgets.": "借钱来还，再加几个分期去约会和买电子产品。",
  "BAD END #23 — Minimum Payment Forever": "坏结局 #23 · 永远只还最低额",
  "Plans stacked on plans, then a loan to pay the plans. Now most of your allowance goes to interest and fees, and the debt grows every month. Buy-now-pay-later is still debt. Add up the total before you tap, and ask for help early: Credit Counselling Singapore is free and confidential.": "分期叠分期，再借钱来还分期。现在你大部分津贴都拿去付利息和手续费，债每个月越滚越大。先买后付还是债。刷之前先算总额，早点求助：新加坡信贷咨询中心免费又保密。",
  "Ryan from your JC class ended up in your section. Of course he did. Perfect outfit every book-out, a feed that looks like a watch ad.": "你JC班上的瑞安，跟你分到同一个班。当然了。每次放假都穿得完美无瑕，社交页面像手表广告。",
  "Bro, can borrow $600? Till allowance day. Promise. You're the only one I trust.": "兄弟，借$600可以吗？发津贴就还。保证。我只信得过你。",
  "He already owes two other guys in the section. They told me.": "他已经欠班上另外两个人钱了。他们跟我讲过。",
  "Ryan is smiling the confident smile of a man who owes $1,400.": "瑞安挂着一个欠了$1,400的人才有的自信笑容。",
  "Say no nicely, and point him to the unit welfare officer or Credit Counselling Singapore.": "客气地拒绝，然后介绍他去找部队福利官或新加坡信贷咨询中心。",
  "...Ya. Okay. Maybe I should actually talk to someone. Don't tell the section?": "……嗯。好。也许我真的该找人谈谈。不要跟班上讲？",
  "I won't. Welfare officer has seen worse. Go on Monday.": "不会。福利官看过更惨的。礼拜一去。",
  "Lend it. He looks so put-together, sure can pay back.": "借他。他看起来那么体面，一定还得起。",
  "A perfect feed isn't a bank statement. Often it's the reason for one.": "完美的社交页面不是银行月结单。很多时候，它就是月结单难看的原因。",
  "Lend half.": "借一半。",
  "Now you're half a creditor and fully awkward at every section dinner.": "现在你是半个债主，每次班上聚餐都尴尬到满分。",
  "Ten minutes to lights out. Mateo, in the next bunk, is doing something on his banking app with great seriousness.": "离熄灯还有十分钟。隔壁床的马特奥正一脸严肃地在用银行App。",
  "Half my allowance to my abuela in Medellín. Every month. She says don't. I do anyway. Then I eat Maggi until payday. ¡Qué rico!": "我的津贴一半寄给麦德林的阿布埃拉。每个月。她说不用。我照寄。然后我吃美极泡面吃到发薪日。¡Qué rico！",
  "He sends half his NS allowance home and lives on instant noodles.": "他把一半的国民服役津贴寄回家，自己靠泡面过活。",
  "He's laughing. Dinner was Maggi again.": "他在笑。晚餐又是美极泡面。",
  "\"Respect, bro. But fix an amount, and keep some for you. Your abuela wants you to eat.\"": "“佩服，兄弟。不过定一个固定数目，留一些给自己。你阿布埃拉也想你吃饱啊。”",
  "A fixed amount. Like a grown-up. Okay, sí. She'll be happy I eat vegetables. One vegetable.": "固定数目。像个大人。好，sí。她会很高兴我吃蔬菜。一种蔬菜。",
  "He set a fixed amount and kept some for himself.": "他定了一个固定数目，也给自己留了一些。",
  "\"Siao ah, half?\"": "“傻的咩，一半？”",
  "She raised me, bro. Half is a small number.": "兄弟，是她把我养大的。一半是很小的数字。",
  "Ryan's phone lights up on his bunk: \"Mam ☘️ calling\". He lets it ring out.": "瑞安床上的手机亮了：“Mam ☘️ 来电”。他让它一直响到停。",
  "Her birthday. It's lunchtime in Cork. I'll call later. Probably.": "她生日。科克那边现在是午餐时间。我晚点再打。应该吧。",
  "The screen goes dark.": "屏幕暗了下来。",
  "\"Two minutes, bro. Just say happy birthday. We won't listen. Much.\"": "“两分钟而已，兄弟。说声生日快乐就好。我们不会偷听。不太会。”",
  "He takes it to the corridor. Through the door: \"Grand, Mam, yeah. ...Happy birthday. I miss you too.\"": "他拿着手机走到走廊。隔着门你听到：“挺好的，妈。嗯。……生日快乐。我也想你。”",
  "Hermano. Beautiful. I'm not crying. NS is very dusty.": "Hermano。太感人了。我没哭。是营里灰尘太多。",
  "Leave it. Not your business.": "随他吧。不关你的事。",
  "Distance doesn't only happen to couples. Sometimes it's a son and his mum.": "距离不只发生在情侣之间。有时候是一个儿子和他的妈妈。",
  "why u didn't reply for an hour?? 😭": "你怎么一个小时都没回？？😭",
  "can we do bintan next month? ferry + resort, i found a deal. only $680": "下个月去民丹岛好不好？渡轮加度假村，我找到配套了。只要$680",
  "can u fly over next month? i found flights. only $680": "下个月你可以飞过来吗？我找到机票了。只要$680",
  "penang next month? \"market research\" for the kiosk. ferry + hostel, i found a deal. only $680": "下个月去槟城？帮摊位做“市场调查”。渡轮加青旅，我找到优惠了。才 $680",
  "can u fly to california next month?? found flights w two layovers. only $680. also i made a spreadsheet of when we're both awake 📊": "下个月你可以飞来加州吗？？找到转两次机的票 只要$680 还有我做了一张表 列出我们两个都醒着的时间 📊",
  "Phones go in the box during training. And $680 is about two months of allowance.": "训练时手机要交进箱子里。而且$680差不多是两个月的津贴。",
  "Distance is hard, and money is real.": "距离很难，钱很现实。",
  "Explain the camp phone rules. Suggest a rhythm you can afford: goodnight text, Sunday call, one trip you save up for. Talk money openly.": "解释营里的手机规定。提议一个负担得起的节奏：晚安简讯、礼拜天通电话、一起存钱的一趟旅行。把钱的事摊开来讲。",
  "ok. sunday calls are sacred. and i'll stop counting minutes. i'll save too, we split the next one": "好。礼拜天的电话神圣不可侵犯。我也不再算你几分钟没回了。我也来存钱，下次我们对分",
  "Talking about money: unromantic. Debt: way more unromantic.": "谈钱：不浪漫。欠债：更不浪漫。",
  "Book it on BNPL.": "用先买后付订下去。",
  "Lovely weekend. Then six months of reminders saying \"remember that lovely weekend?\"": "很美好的周末。然后是六个月的还款提醒：“还记得那个美好的周末吗？”",
  "Text back thirty times a day, even from the camp toilet.": "一天回三十次简讯，连在营里厕所都在回。",
  "One long call beats a hundred anxious \"where are you\"s.": "一通长长的电话，胜过一百句焦虑的“你在哪”。",
  "Bro, every book-out you busy. I panic when you don't reply for an hour. Also, Bali? Only $680. Next month, jom!": "兄弟，你每次放假都很忙。你一个小时没回我就慌了。还有，峇厘岛？只要$680。下个月，走啦！",
  "Haziq misses you. Your wallet does not miss Bali.": "哈齐克想你了。你的钱包不想峇厘岛。",
  "Explain the camp phone box. Saturday supper every book-out, and save up for a cheaper trip together.": "解释营里的手机箱。每次放假礼拜六一起吃宵夜，再一起存钱去比较便宜的地方。",
  "Saturday supper. Sacred. And JB day trip instead. Fine. You're so adult now, it's disgusting.": "礼拜六宵夜。神圣不可侵犯。那改去新山一日游。好啦。你现在成熟到让人恶心。",
  "Book Bali on BNPL.": "用先买后付订峇厘岛。",
  "Bali was great. The six payments after Bali, less so.": "峇厘岛很棒。之后的六期分期，没那么棒。",
  "A few weeks later. You've barely talked to anyone. Every book-out you game till 5 AM and sleep till 3 PM. Everything feels grey.": "几个礼拜后。你几乎没跟任何人讲话。每次放假都打游戏到早上五点，睡到下午三点。一切都灰灰的。",
  "Twelve unread messages. You haven't opened any.": "十二条未读信息。你一条都没打开。",
  "Call Mei. Join the weekend run club. Book a chat with the unit counsellor, or call mindline 1771.": "打给小美。参加周末跑步团。约部队辅导员聊聊，或者打给mindline 1771。",
  "Of course I pick up. Even from Tokyo. Even at 2 AM. ...Thanks for calling instead of disappearing, okay?": "我当然会接啊。在东京也接。凌晨两点也接。……谢谢你打来，而不是消失，知道吗？",
  "Soldiers need maintenance too. Especially soldiers.": "军人也需要保养。尤其是军人。",
  "\"I'm fine.\" Stay in the room.": "“我没事。”继续待在房间里。",
  "\"I'm fine\": Singapore's most popular lie. If the grey lasts weeks, talk to someone. mindline 1771. Don't wait for worse.": "“我没事”：全新加坡最常见的谎话。如果灰灰的感觉持续好几个礼拜，找人谈谈。mindline 1771。不用等到更糟。",
  "Book-out weekend. Ah Ma has a bruise on her arm the size of a mandarin orange. \"Bump the door only.\" Mum's face says she doesn't believe it.": "放假回家的周末。阿嬷手臂上有一块柑那么大的瘀青。“只是撞到门。”妈妈的表情说她不信。",
  "She hid a fall so nobody would spend money on her.": "她隐瞒跌倒，好让没人为她花钱。",
  "Don't tell your mother. Polyclinic so expensive. I don't want to trouble anybody.": "不要跟你妈讲。综合诊疗所那么贵。我不想麻烦任何人。",
  "She hid her fall to protect the family, not herself.": "她隐瞒跌倒是为了保护家人，不是保护自己。",
  "Ah Ma is asking you to keep a secret.": "阿嬷要你帮她保守秘密。",
  "\"You're not trouble, Ah Ma.\" Tell Mum together, and check the CHAS and MediSave rules for her visit.": "“阿嬷，你不是麻烦。”一起跟妈妈讲，再帮她查清楚这次看诊的 CHAS 和保健储蓄规定。",
  "You told Mum together, and showed her it wouldn't cost what she feared.": "你们一起告诉了妈妈，也让她知道费用没有她担心的那么多。",
  "Ma. Next time you call me first. Not after. First.": "妈。下次你先打给我。不是之后，是先。",
  "Preet teacher also say same thing. She put the ScamShield for me last week. Very clever girl.": "普丽特老师也是这样讲。她上个礼拜帮我装了 ScamShield。很聪明的女孩子。",
  "Keep her secret. She asked.": "帮她保守秘密。是她要求的。",
  "Respecting her is right. Hiding a fall from the people who'd help is not the same thing.": "尊重她是对的。但对会帮忙的人隐瞒跌倒，是两回事。",
  "My cousin's agency says she 'owes' them eight months' salary for placement. Then they keep her passport. That's not a loan, that's a trap. I told her: call the MOM hotline. She says she can't say no to them.": "我表妹的中介说她“欠”他们八个月的薪水当安置费，然后还扣着她的护照。那不是贷款，是陷阱。我叫她打人力部的热线。她说她没办法对他们说不。",
  "She spent her day off helping her cousin fight an agency loan.": "她用休假日帮表妹对抗中介贷款。",
  "You saw the same habit in her that she warned her cousin about.": "你在她身上看到了她提醒表妹要小心的同一个习惯。",
  "Book-out dinner. Mei wants to give Mum and Dad a monthly allowance. {her}: \"And later, would you want a flat near your parents? Or mine?\"": "出营回家的晚餐。小美想每个月给爸妈零用钱。{her}：“那以后，你会想住你爸妈附近吗？还是我爸妈？”",
  "\"I want to think about it with you. What does looking after parents mean in your family?\"": "“我想跟你一起想。在你家，照顾父母是什么意思？”",
  "\"No rush. Build our own lives first, then decide.\"": "“不急。先把我们自己的生活过好，再决定。”",
  "\"Somewhere in between. Close enough to help, far enough to be us.\"": "“中间吧。近到可以帮忙，远到还是我们自己。”",
  "\"Near the parents, as early as we can. Family helps family.\"": "“住父母附近，越早越好。一家人互相帮忙。”",
  "\"BTO talk at nineteen? So auntie.\"": "“十九岁就讲BTO？好安娣哦。”",
  "A free book-out evening. Where does it go?": "一个空闲的放假傍晚。要去哪里？"
});
